      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "<Page>/\n├── <Page>.md                  reader page\n├── labeling/                  the job's own state\n│   ├── config.yaml            construct + authority\n│   ├── corpus/                manifest + dev items\n│   ├── policy/\n│   │   ├── current\n│   │   └── versions/G_XX/     versioned policy\n│   ├── rounds/round_NN/\n│   │   ├── card.md            proposed commission\n│   │   ├── manifest.yaml      frozen batch\n│   │   ├── sessions/events.jsonl\n│   │   ├── human_final.jsonl\n│   │   ├── checkpoint.json\n│   │   └── view/*.md          rendered only\n│   ├── gold/                  human-confirmed gold\n│   ├── test/                  sealed custody + lock\n│   ├── evaluation/            executor qualification\n│   ├── production/            scans + risk review\n│   ├── audit/                 independent final check\n│   ├── handoff/               signed crossing\n│   ├── corpus/final/          audited D*\n│   ├── gates/                 gate receipts\n│   ├── cache/                 derived embeddings\n│   ├── exposure/              logged text requests\n│   └── REPORT.md              derived summary",
