      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. No page bar: the title, the Space tabs, then the content with its Runs panel on the right.\n2. A view lists only its own Run types; types not built yet stay in the Workflow map.\n3. Resume, Rerun, Copy and + New Run only copy a prompt; none starts a Run.\n4. runs/ and results/ sit beside labeling/; Workflow and All runs open from ?drawer=.\n5. A build or a round and its runs pick each other; a rerun on one target is named -2.\n6. An empty slot stays blank: no dash, no \"not implemented\".",
      "originalText": "1. No page bar: the title, the Space tabs, then the content with its Runs panel on the right.\n2. A view lists only its own Run types; types not built yet stay in the Workflow map.\n3. Resume, Rerun, Copy and + New Run only copy a prompt; none starts a Run.\n4. runs/ and results/ sit beside labeling/; Workflow and All runs open from ?drawer=.\n5. A build or a round and its runs pick each other; a rerun on one target is named -2.\n6. An empty slot stays blank: no dash, no \"not implemented\".",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
